Upstream-Name: xpilot-ng
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/bartromb/xpilot-ng/issues
Source: https://github.com/bartromb/xpilot-ng
Comment:
 XPilot NG's own last release was in 2010 and its authors are no longer
 active. This package builds from a revival fork; the original authors'
 README is preserved in the source as README, and their names and copyright
 stand unchanged in the file headers.

